  a bound for the physical geometry and pointwise-roof input in a declared roof norm;
\item
  an orbit-tail bound for the complete orbit-and-repetition representation;
\item
  a rank or projection bound for the selected operator space and basis;
\item
  a quadrature or determinant-evaluation bound on the declared complex domain; and
\item
  a roundoff bound tied to arithmetic precision, algorithms, and stopping rules.
\end{enumerate}
